        "original_id": "79add37a-c345-5f4f-be18-61e1d4b53138",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Victor Garber, Teri Copley\n- Television series: I Had Three Wives, We Got It Made, Alias\n- Films and stage works: Godspell, Assassins, Lend Me a Tenor, Titanic, Argo\n- Roles: lead, Jesus, Anthony Hope, John Wilkes Booth, Jack Bristow, Max, Thomas Andrews, Ken Taylor\n\nFacts:\n- In 1983, Teri Copley had a role on the American NBC/syndicated television series \"We Got It Made,\" which premiered that year.\n- In 1985, Teri Copley co-starred on the CBS television series \"I Had Three Wives.\"\n- Victor Garber was the lead of \"I Had Three Wives,\" and it was his first starring role on television.\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Jesus in \"Godspell.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Anthony Hope in \"Sweeney Todd.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing John Wilkes Booth in \"Assassins.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Jack Bristow in the television series \"Alias.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Max in \"Lend Me a Tenor.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Thomas Andrews in James Cameron's \"Titanic.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for portraying Ken Taylor, the Canadian Ambassador to Iran, in \"Argo.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "1c29ed5d-0152-5cb2-9902-af596899da83",
        "text": "Page: I Had Three Wives. Sentence: The series' lead was Victor Garber in his first starring role on television.\nPage: Victor Garber. Sentence: He is known for playing Jesus in \"Godspell\", Anthony Hope in \"\", John Wilkes Booth in \"Assassins\", Jack Bristow in the television series \"Alias\", Max in \"Lend Me a Tenor\", Thomas Andrews in James Cameron's \"Titanic\", and Ken Taylor, Canadian Ambassador to Iran, in \"Argo\".\nPage: Teri Copley. Sentence: She is known for role on the American NBC/syndicated television series \"We Got It Made\" which premiered in 1983, and she subsequently co-starred on the 1985 CBS television series \"I Had Three Wives\".",
